  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Fruit Salad.png|200px|left|Fruit salad]]\n\n{{Infobox\n |title = [[Products|Product]]\n |level = 82\n |price = 1 to 597\n |time = 2 h\n |source = {{Infoicon|saladb|bigger|link=Salad Bar}}\n |xp = 71\n |base = 166\n |dia = 5\n |time3 = 1 h 42 min\n}}\n'''Fruit salad''' is a [[Products|product]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 82. It is not used to make any other product.\n\nLike all [[products]], it is stored in the [[barn]].\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Making fruit salad'''===\n[[File:Salad Bar.png|150px|left|Salad Bar]]\nFruit salad is made in the [[Salad Bar]].\n\nTo make the salad, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: .5em 0;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Blackberry.png|75px|link=Blackberry|Blackberries]]\n|[[File:Honey.png|75px|link=Honey|Honey]]\n|[[File:Orange.png|75px|link=Orange|Orange]]\n|[[File:Strawberry.png|75px|link=Strawberry|Strawberries]]\n|-\n|'''x2'''\n|'''x1'''\n|'''x1'''\n|'''x3'''\n|}\nIt takes 2 hours to make one bowl, and 1 hours and 42 minutes in a fully [[Masteries|mastered]] bar. Each salad gives players 71 [[experience]] points.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Selling fruit salad'''===\n[[File:Roadside Shop.png|150px|left|Roadside shop]]\n* Fruit salad can be bought or sold for a maximum price of 5,976 {{Infoicon|coin}} for 10 bowls.\n* Buying the ingredients required to make a salad costs 565 {{Infoicon|coin}}.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Boat orders'''===\n[[File:Riverboat.png|150px|left|Riverboat]]\n* [[Boat]] orders ask for 1 fruit salad per crate, up to a total of 4 per boat.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Fruchtsalat\n|es = Ensalada de frutas\n|fr = Salade de Fruits\n|it = Macedonia di frutta\n|nl = Fruitsalade\n|no = Fruktsalat\n|ru = Фруктовый салат\n|zh = Fruit Salad\n}}\n[[pt-br:Salada de frutas]]\n\n[[Category:Salad Bar Products]]\n[[Category:Blackberry Products]]\n[[Category:Strawberry Products]]\n[[Category:Honey Products]]\n[[Category:Orange Products]]",
